        'name_h' => 'The name and the bars', 'name_p' => 'Each letter is reduced to the fewest strokes that still make it recognisable, all leaning the same way: i and l are one bar, e is three dashes, r is a long bar and a short one, o is its top and bottom, m is three bars. In a row they spell the name; the three bars of the m alone are the mark.',
